# Conformance probe pack for the field option `stop <code>` on a fixed-size
# `chars` field (spec 0.22): 64 bits of `ascii8` whose text ends at the first
# NUL; the bytes after it are ignored. Public. No kinds. Most significant bit
# first.
#
#   bytes 0..7    label  up to 7 characters, NUL, then NUL padding
format     conformance-long-stop
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
word_bytes 1
bit_order  msb
field   probe.label  0:0:64  chars:ascii8  stop 0
